<div class="container masterplan">

<h1 id="top">Comserv2 — Master Plan (coordinator)</h1>

<div class="last-updated" style="color: var(--text-muted-color); font-size: var(--font-size-small);">
    Created: 2026-08-01 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Version: 1.2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Status: COORDINATOR
</div>

<p>This is the single entry point for "what do we build next, and in what order". It does <strong>not</strong>
replace any sub-plan — it sequences them, records what is done, and names the gates between them. Each
sub-plan remains the authoritative spec for its own work.</p>

<div class="notice">
    <strong>On navigation:</strong> every plan below is viewable in-browser. <code>.tt</code> plans render as full
    app templates (global nav + themed chrome). <code>.md</code> plans render through the markdown viewer
    (header with site/role/last-updated, "Documentation Home" breadcrumb, Suggest-Edit / Expand-All / Print,
    collapsible <code>##</code> sections, footer with Home + Go-Back). Links in both render clickable — use the
    routes in the index below.
</div>

