            <li><strong>Order queue</strong> sub-plan — <em>blocks Phase 5</em>.</li>
            <li><strong>Production / prep-stage</strong> sub-plan — <em>blocks Phase 6</em>.</li>
        </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Phases: 0 review → 1 split <code>Inventory.pm</code> + extract <code>Util::Inventory::Cart</code> → 2 <code>OrderOptions</code> + <code>/order/configure</code> → 3 schema + <code>Checkout</code> writes order+invoice → 4 payment registry (PayPal extract, consignment) → 5 <code>OrderQueue</code> + <code>Picking</code> + <code>/orders/*</code> → 6 <code>Production</code> contract + 3D provider → 7 docs (expand <code>Inventory/index.tt</code> §4.3, update <code>features/3d_printing.tt</code>, supersede LedgerSMB doc per doc standard S6).</li>
</ul>

