<h2 id="decisions">4. Open decisions needed from the user</h2>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Deploy backup/rename fix</strong> — approve the 4-line naming edit + the <code>docker commit</code> backup fix, after the current build finishes. Unblocks W1.1.</li>
    <li><strong>OFT Remaining Todos</strong> — confirm superseded by AI2 migration and close, or name any piece still wanted.</li>
    <li><strong>Inventory start timing</strong> — Wave 4 (after 3D print queue) or start just Phase 0–1 (cart/Inventory.pm split) earlier, since that is independent of the 3D queue.</li>
    <li><strong>Static::Simple absolute include_path</strong> — confirm the one-line core-config change (W1.4) is in scope now.</li>
    <li><strong>K8s/infra cluster</strong> — confirm which migration plans are still live (vs. superseded by the canonical Deploy Workflow) so the coordinator doesn't over-schedule them.</li>
</ol>

